### Kevalon ERP — Module 20: Notifications, Reminders & Alerts
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@userId = REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID
@companyId = REPLACE_WITH_COMPANY_ID
@notificationId = REPLACE_WITH_NOTIFICATION_ID
@alertId = REPLACE_WITH_ALERT_ID

### My notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications?userId={{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark a notification read
PUT {{baseUrl}}/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Configure a GST reminder
POST {{baseUrl}}/reminders/config
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "type": "GST_DUE",
  "daysBefore": 7,
  "enabled": true,
  "channels": ["BELL", "EMAIL"],
  "config": { "period": "monthly" }
}

### Scheduled reminders
GET {{baseUrl}}/reminders?companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Active alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/alerts?companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Acknowledge alert
PUT {{baseUrl}}/alerts/{{alertId}}/acknowledge
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
